 class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" href=\"?note=ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" title=\"./18-df-relativization\">18-df-relativization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"963197a11f1d0acc\" href=\"?note=963197a11f1d0acc\" title=\"./18-df-kp-minus\">18-df-kp-minus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"./18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 12.1.1 (Admissible extension)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"298"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"306"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=\\}\\cup C\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=\\}\\cup C\\)</span> 是纯集合论语言加常元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是给定句子公理集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"./18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a> 的句子集，公式语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\notin C\">\\(U\\notin C\\)</span> 是全新常元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^U\">\\(F^U\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^U\">\\(T^U\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" href=\"?note=ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" title=\"./18-df-relativization\">18-df-relativization</a> 的捕获规避相对化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}}\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L\\cup\\{U\\}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"963197a11f1d0acc\" href=\"?note=963197a11f1d0acc\" title=\"./18-df-kp-minus\">18-df-kp-minus</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a>。</li>\n<li>本节只定义无非零元函数符号的语言特例，故闭项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 中常元。它不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的预期模型已存在，也不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(T^+)\">\\(\\mathcal L(T^+)\\)</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的变量集和枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^U\">\\(T^U\\)</span> 在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" href=\"?note=ccb1a85e29ea0a39\" title=\"./18-df-relativization\">18-df-relativization</a> 的目标签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L&#39;=\\mathcal L(T^+)\">\\(\\mathcal L&#39;=\\mathcal L(T^+)\\)</span> 中计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\\)</span> 使用该常元扩张中的公式模板。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；空符号列按正元数索引。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的变量集及其枚举固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,(w_i)_{i&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W,(w_i)_{i&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L(T^+)}\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L(T^+)}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\\)</span> 均满足被引用定义的同签名输入条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(T^+)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(\\mathcal L;\\{U\\},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1}),\n\\qquad\nT^+\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L(T^+)}\n\\cup T^U\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\\}\n\\cup\\{c\\in U:c\\in C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L(T^+)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(\\mathcal L;\\{U\\},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1}),\n\\qquad\nT^+\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{KP}^{-}_{\\mathcal L(T^+)}\n\\cup T^U\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Tran}_{\\in}(U)\\}\n\\cup\\{c\\in U:c\\in C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项对应 Definition 12.1.1 的三组公理：原理论的 U 相对化、U 的传递性和闭项归属、环境 KP⁻。此处的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span> 在集合构造的索引侧属于元语言，所生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in U\">\\(c\\in U\\)</span> 是对象句。</p>\n<p>完整基础模式没有被加入；这正是本章后续证明论强度变化的重要条件。定义理论的公理集合并不证明理论有模型，也不等于完成原书 RSS、Sᵁ、非对称解释及 T⁺ 到 T 的归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"ccb1a85e29ea0a39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-relativization]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-kp-minus","status":"resolved","id":"963197a11f1d0acc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-kp-minus]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp